        ],
        "text": "Before we start: this one needs your hands, so it is not a driving lesson. You will want a pen and something to write on and your eyes, for letter shapes on the page. You can listen to everything else now. I will say so again when we reach them, but leave these sections until you have stopped: Warm-up, Script — 二, then 儿 under it and Guided Practice."
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
