          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "jiàqián names the price as a fact, the figure on the list; duōshao qián asks it aloud."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "太 … 了 is still the complaint: jiàqián tài guì le."
